  "parentName": "Dickson.fixes_infinity_coprime_isCyclic",
  "oldText":
  "let h_equiv : H ≃ f.range :=\n    Equiv.ofBijective (fun x ↦ ⟨f x, ⟨x, rfl⟩⟩) ⟨\n      fun _ _ hxy ↦ h_inj (congr_arg Subtype.val hxy),\n      fun ⟨_, ⟨x, hx⟩⟩ ↦ ⟨x, Subtype.ext hx⟩\n    ⟩",
